# Exceptions to scripts/docs_lint.py: path-suffix<TAB>regex, one per line.
# A hit is allowed when its file path ends with the suffix and the line
# matches the regex. Every entry says why it is not a leak of one site.

# The compose smoke stack runs on the reader's own machine.
getting-started/try-it.md	localhost

# A code default that still names one institution's IIIF source (the
# converter's source_template). Remove this entry when that default is made
# neutral in code.
reference/configuration.md	arkis!\{ref\}

# The S3 bucket-policy language version is a fixed string, not a date.
.md	"Version": "2012-10-17"


# The slides that introduce ResourceFlavor and pod sizes use real GPU models
# as the example of telling hardware apart; they describe no one site's cluster.
distributed-htrflow.md	A100 or L4|takes an A100 if one is free, an L4 if not|flavor: (l4|a100), +gpu: 1
